# The previous libssh2/libpcre2 exceptions were resolved by v2.0.8. The findings
# below are new Debian base-image advisories reported on 2026-10-18 with trivy
# 0.76.0 against the unchanged v2.0.8 digest.
#
# MyUrls is a Rust service that compose starts directly. perl-base is a Debian
# Essential package and no perl code path is invoked by the service; libpcre2 is a
# base-library dependency and the service does not compile attacker-controlled
# regular expressions. v2.0.8 is still the newest upstream tag and its digest has
# not been rebuilt, so no fixed release is available.
#
# Recheck this file whenever the locked MyUrls image digest changes.
